# 🔐 Password Manager CLI

A simple command-line Password Manager developed in Python.

This project was created as part of my Python learning journey, focusing on modular programming, JSON persistence, secure password generation, and clean code.

---

## Features

- Add new passwords
- View saved passwords
- Search passwords by website
- Update passwords
- Delete passwords
- Generate secure passwords
- Save data to JSON
- Load data automatically

---

## Technologies

- Python 3
- JSON
- secrets
- string
- os

